                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">exploration rivalries on pearl river</hi>.</head>
                <p>Last week a party of officers of Her Britannic Majesty’s steamer Scout, heavily
                    armed with champagne and sardines, and accompanied by an auxiliary party of
                    friends, made a reconuoissance in Ewa Harbor, for pleasure or science, we don’t
                    know which—perhaps for both.</p>
                <p>Yesterday two steam-launches, with a large party of officers from the California,
                    proceeded to the lagoon to remain several days, in order to make a thorough
                    survey. The report from the hydrographic bureau about Pearl River will be a
                    valuable one when it comes to hand.</p>
            </div>
